下面这段存储过程有两个缺陷：声明顺序不合法，且循环无法正常结束。请指出并给出修复后的完整定义。

```sql
DELIMITER $$
CREATE PROCEDURE p_raise(IN p_pct DECIMAL(5,2))
BEGIN
    DECLARE v_done INT DEFAULT 0;
    DECLARE cur_emp CURSOR FOR SELECT id, salary FROM employee WHERE status = 1;
    DECLARE v_id  BIGINT;
    DECLARE v_sal DECIMAL(10,2);
    DECLARE CONTINUE HANDLER FOR NOT FOUND SET v_done = 1;
    OPEN cur_emp;
    WHILE 1 = 1 DO
        FETCH cur_emp INTO v_id, v_sal;
        UPDATE employee SET salary = v_sal * (1 + p_pct / 100) WHERE id = v_id;
    END WHILE;
    CLOSE cur_emp;
END$$
DELIMITER ;
```

